  "statement": "$f(x) = x^2 - [$m.c]$ on $[[$m.l], [$m.u]]$. After one bisection step, what are the new ends?\n\na) new $x_l$ =\n\n[______]{a}\n\nb) new $x_u$ =\n\n[______]{b}",
